{
"note_claim": "The note claims that 8 U.S.C. § 1254a, Subsection (b)(5)(A) states there is no judicial review of the Attorney General's determination regarding designation, termination, or extension of a foreign state.",
"label": "SUPPORTS",
"quote": "There is no judicial review of any determination of the Attorney General with respect to the designation, or termination or extension of a designation, of a foreign state under this subsection.",
"reason": "The provided text of 8 U.S.C. § 1254a explicitly contains the exact language quoted in the note under subsection (b)(5)(A)."
}
